{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/ChatGPT_Image_2025\u5e744\u670814\u65e5_19_15_19.png?t=1746097238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xiao Wang phone store\u00a0simulator a mobile phone sales and management simulation game, players through reasonable management, earn money, expand the scale of the store, open the secret room. You will become the owner of Xiao Wang's Repair Shop and expand its scale. By purchasing second-hand mobile phones, refurbishing and repairing them, you can earn gold coins. Then, you can open the mysterious chamber and explore the secrets hidden within. Unravel the secrets left by Xiao Wang.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/39734DE0-573C-4EAA-B74F-D666431D5EBE.png?t=1746097238\" />You can buy a mobile phone directly on the computer or draw a blind box, make sure you have enough money before drawing the blind box, otherwise it is easy to go bankrupt.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/9F1444DD-F493-4953-A965-C422CCEA8AC7.png?t=1746097238\" />In the blind box you have the opportunity to make a fortune on a luxury phone, but you need to fix it first.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/6FBB36A1-90C4-404F-B72E-3EF1C45D363A.png?t=1746097238\" />If the repair fails, the phone will explode directly, and even the most luxurious mobile phone can only be sold as scrap for 50 yuan.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/B3BC68D1-2CD9-4428-816F-4521E2DA9B59.png?t=1746097238\" />You can display your phone on a display case, which can be used to attract customers.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/DDE400B4-58C6-4B29-A370-C927FE778E78.png?t=1746097238\" />You can earn money to expand your shop, but it costs a lot of gold.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/BDC7CF37-4FBD-4909-95CD-B0EB2ADF5290.png?t=1746097238\" />You can create your own wall of phone in a larger store<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/AC2B2AF6-B9B2-47B3-8975-D492D52BDE56.png?t=1746097238\" />There are also a lot of easter eggs hidden in the game, which can be on the street, in a store, or in a secret room, which will not prompt anything, some may have to be clicked, and some may have to wait a while to trigger.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"capitalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3514840/c1fbb55fc5b37efa7294b0fd42aa2b918d18e420.jpg"},{"name":"People's Entrepreneurs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3514840/35dc9a6094375caabc4a885534fdd32f0b085ada.jpg"},{"name":"Successors of communism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3514840/14b6f0bb05504f14d2e09f09787cf4ec9e1da20d.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514840?t=1746097238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514840?t=1746097238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/0d5bbf917f6bcd167d092cc2300a5ded9385d3bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746097238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/0d5bbf917f6bcd167d092cc2300a5ded9385d3bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746097238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri