ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/DDE400B4-58C6-4B29-A370-C927FE778E78.png?t=1746097238\" />You can earn money to expand your shop, but it costs a lot of gold.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/BDC7CF37-4FBD-4909-95CD-B0EB2ADF5290.png?t=1746097238\" />You can create your own wall of phone in a larger store<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/extras/AC2B2AF6-B9B2-47B3-8975-D492D52BDE56.png?t=1746097238\" />There are also a lot of easter eggs hidden in the game, which can be on the street, in a store, or in a secret room, which will not prompt anything, some may have to be clicked, and some may have to wait a while to trigger.</p>","developers":["Gold Treasure"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514840/10fdbf4ca6bd1742ee6f89e55a40ab04f443cc83/header.jpg?t=1746097238","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game is an original work. Some content comes from the Internet.If you have any questions, please contact us via email.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128413,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128413/movie480.mp4?t=1745189357","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128413/movie_max.mp4?t=1745189357"},"name":"xuan3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.stea